&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;SDGs12-5&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;SDGs13-1&lt;/p&gt;
